#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:448
msgid "Auto-fetch trackables during logging"
msgstr "Trackables beim Loggen automatisch abrufen"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:451
msgid ""
"When a cache log includes a TB action with a tracking code (discover /\n"
"                retrieve / grab), automatically fetch the TB's metadata + "
"images from GC\n"
"                and store the tracking code locally. Off by default — turn "
"on if you want\n"
"                ad-hoc discoveries to populate your trackable list without a "
"separate sync."
msgstr ""
"Wenn ein Cache-Log eine TB-Aktion mit Tracking-Code enthält (Discover /\n"
"                Retrieve / Grab), werden die TB-Metadaten und Bilder "
"automatisch von GC abgerufen\n"
"                und der Tracking-Code lokal gespeichert. Standardmäßig aus — "
"einschalten, falls\n"
"                Ad-hoc-Discoveries deine Trackable-Liste ohne separaten Sync "
"füllen sollen."

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:469
msgid ""
"Fills fields not provided by import sources.\n"
"            <strong>Elevation</strong> uses offline SRTM tiles (downloaded "
"once, then no internet required).\n"
"            <strong>Location</strong> (country, state, county) uses\n"
"            <a href=\"https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenStreetMap Nominatim</a>\n"
"            (requires internet; 1 request/s rate limit).\n"
"            Only blank fields are ever filled — existing values are never "
"overwritten."
msgstr ""
"Füllt Felder, die von Import-Quellen nicht bereitgestellt werden.\n"
"            <strong>Höhe</strong> verwendet Offline-SRTM-Kacheln (einmalig "
"heruntergeladen, danach kein Internet nötig).\n"
"            <strong>Standort</strong> (Land, Bundesland, Landkreis) "
"verwendet\n"
"            <a href=\"https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/\" "
"target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">OpenStreetMap Nominatim</a>\n"
"            (benötigt Internet; 1 Anfrage/s Rate-Limit).\n"
"            Nur leere Felder werden je gefüllt — vorhandene Werte werden nie "
"überschrieben."

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:483
msgid ""
"<strong>Auto-enrich after import</strong>\n"
"                  <span class=\"text-muted small ms-1\">— run enrichment "
"automatically when new caches are imported</span>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Automatisch anreichern nach Import</strong>\n"
"                  <span class=\"text-muted small ms-1\">— Anreicherung "
"automatisch ausführen, wenn neue Caches importiert werden</span>"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:491
msgid "Fill elevation from SRTM"
msgstr "Höhe aus SRTM füllen"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:496
msgid "Fill country / state / county from OpenStreetMap"
msgstr "Land / Bundesland / Landkreis aus OpenStreetMap füllen"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:501
msgid "Import behaviour"
msgstr "Import-Verhalten"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:506
msgid ""
"<strong>Drop lat/lon 0°/0° waypoints during import</strong>\n"
"                <span class=\"text-muted ms-1\">— some CO use 0,0 as a "
"placeholder; these break the map</span>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Lat/Lon 0°/0°-Waypoints beim Import verwerfen</strong>\n"
"                <span class=\"text-muted ms-1\">— einige Owner nutzen 0,0 "
"als Platzhalter; diese stören die Karte</span>"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:517
msgid "Fill location gaps from downloaded boundaries"
msgstr ""
"Lücken bei Land/Region/Landkreis aus heruntergeladenen Grenzdaten füllen"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:519
msgid ""
"Walks every cache with coordinates and assigns country (always), state and "
"county (where you've downloaded the matching boundary). Pure point-in-"
"polygon — no internet needed."
msgstr ""
"Geht jeden Cache mit Koordinaten durch und weist Land (immer), Region und "
"Landkreis (sofern die passenden Grenzdaten heruntergeladen sind) zu. Reines "
"Point-in-Polygon — kein Internet nötig."

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:531
msgid "Also overwrite existing values (default is fill-only)"
msgstr "Auch bestehende Werte überschreiben (Standard: nur Lücken füllen)"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:534
msgid "Run now"
msgstr "Jetzt ausführen"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:546
msgid "Geocaching username"
msgstr "Geocaching-Benutzername"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:552
msgid "e.g. YourGCName"
msgstr "z. B. DeinGCName"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:555
msgid "Used to identify your logs in GPX exports (your logs appear first)."
msgstr ""
"Wird verwendet, um deine Logs in GPX-Exporten zu identifizieren (deine Logs "
