msgstr "Alte jetzt löschen"

#: .\templates\preferences\settings.html:2311
msgid ""
"Runs exactly once when you click. Pre-filled with your auto-delete\n"
"              threshold above when set, otherwise <code>90</code>. Values "
"must be\n"
"              ≥ 1; use the setting above (with <code>0</code>) to disable\n"
"              automatic pruning."
